fixture pilgrims_wick_in_the_air
doc docs/adr/0015, what run speed covers: the most Ash runs at in the air too (air control's "0 to max in 8 f", BUILD.md s5 Jump). A jump from a full run keeps 2488 sub-pixels a tick through the air and on landing.
room test/flat
option votive_pilgrims_wick 1
frames 60
input
  0..9 R
  10 R jump
  11..59 R
end
expect
  at 10 event.jump=1
  during 10..59 vx=2488
  mark land 11..59 event.land=1
end
